## 1. Purpose

The Automotive Communication Simulator ("Software") is an educational software project designed to help students, engineers, researchers, educators, and automotive enthusiasts learn and experiment with automotive communication technologies and concepts.

The Software may include simulations, models, protocols, interfaces, tools, documentation, examples, and other materials related to automotive communication systems.

This License permits the Software to be freely used for personal, educational, academic, research, and other non-commercial purposes, subject to the terms below.

